OL,3,AIs a September heatwave forecast for
OL,4,Athe UK?
OL,5,
OL,6,FTemperatures are set to climb across
OL,7,Fthe UK this weekend, reaching
OL,8,Fsummerlike levels in some places.
OL,10,FIt will feel warm and muggy -
OL,11,Fespecially where there are sunny spells
OL,12,F- although heavy rain also features in
OL,13,Fthe forecast.
OL,15,FThe warmth will persist into Monday in
OL,16,Fmany areas but nowhere is expected to
OL,17,Freach heatwave criteria and cooler
OL,18,Fconditions are due to return by
OL,19,Fmidweek.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
